pg033_n0020\">Çka paraqesin motivet në xhubletë?</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <details class=\"discussion-responses\">\n      <summary>Shëno përgjigjet (opsionale)</summary>\n      <label for=\"item-1\">Përgjigjja 1</label>\n      <textarea id=\"item-1\" data-activity-item=\"item-1\" aria-labelledby=\"prompt-1\"></textarea>\n      <label for=\"item-2\">Përgjigjja 2</label>\n      <textarea id=\"item-2\" data-activity-item=\"item-2\" aria-labelledby=\"prompt-2\"></textarea>\n      <label for=\"item-3\">Përgjigjja 3</label>\n      <input id=\"item-3\" type=\"text\" data-activity-item=\"item-3\" aria-labelledby=\"prompt-3\">\n    </details>\n  </section>\n</div>\n    </main>\n\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n    <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js?v=9f3d745a858de581\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n\n\n\n<script src=\"./book-design/responses.js?v=9f3d745a858de581\" data-book-responses=\"true\"></script></body></html>","./pg033_sec003.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq\"><head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Shoqëria dhe mjedisi</title>\n  <meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg033_sec003\">\n  <meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"51\">\n  <link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"./book-design/components.css?v=9f3d745a858de581\" data-book-style=\"true\">\n  <style>\n    /* Focused view of the two lower blocks of source page 33. PatrickHand is\n       unavailable; the handwritten system fallback is intentionally distinct\n       from the Poppins used for questions. */\n    #content.book.p33 { container-type:inline-size; padding:0 0 120px; }\n    #content.book.p33 > section { width:83%; margin:0 2.3% 0 14.7%; padding:5.2cqw 0 0; }\n    #content.book.p33 .reading { position:relative; border:3px solid #7950aa; border-right:0; border-radius:0 0 0 20px; padding-bottom:1.5cqw; }\n    #content.book.p33 .reading-badge { position:absolute; top:-3px; left:-3px; width:10.96%; height:auto; }\n    #content.book.p33 .reading h1, #content.book.p33 .glossary h2 { font-family:\"Comic Sans MS\", \"Segoe Print\", cursive; font-weight:400; color:#30313a; margin:0; }\n    #content.book.p33 .reading h1 { font-size:2.815cqw; line-height:1.2; padding:2.0cqw 0 2.8cqw 11.6%; }\n    #content.book.p33 .passage { margin-left:1.2%; width:87.4%; }\n    #content.book.p33 .passage p { font:400 1.877cqw/2.502cqw BookAmiri, Georgia, serif; color:#30313a; text-align:justify; margin:0; }\n    #content.book.p33 .passage .opening { text-indent:6.2cqw; text-align:left; }\n    #content.book.p33 .glossary { margin:12.1cqw 0 0 2.5%; background:#d5c6df; display:flex; align-items:center; min-height:10.8cqw; }\n    #content.book.p33 .glossary img { flex:none; width:15.8%; align-self:stretch; object-fit:fill; }\n    #content.book.p33 .glossary-copy { padding:0 1.6cqw; }\n    #content.book.p33 .glossary h2 { font-size:2.5cqw; line-height:1.15; }\n    #content.book.p33 .glossary p { font:400 1.877cqw/1.4 BookAmiri, Georgia, serif; margin:0; }\n    #content.book.p33 .folio { font:400 1.877cqw/1.3 BookPoppins, Arial, sans-serif; text-align:right; margin:1cqw 10% 0 0; }\n    @media (max-width:700px) {\n      #content.book.p33 { padding:0 0 120px; }\n      #content.book.p33 > section { width:auto; margin:0 18px; padding:24px 0 0; }\n      #content.book.p33 .reading { border-width:2px; padding-bottom:16px; }\n      #content.book.p33 .reading-badge { top:-2px; left:-2px; width:70px; }\n      #content.book.p33 .reading h1 { font-size:25px; min-height:83px; padding:19px 8px 12px 82px; }\n      #content.book.p33 .passage { width:auto; margin:0 14px 0 10px; }\n      #content.book.p33 .passage p { font-size:19px; line-height:1.4; text-align:left; }\n      #content.book.p33 .passage .opening { text-indent:0; }\n      #content.book.p33 .glossary { margin:40px 0 0 0; min-height:90px; }\n      #content.book.p33 .glossary img { width:94px; align-self:center; }\n      #content.book.p33 .glossary-copy { padding:8px 12px; }\n      #content.book.p33 .glossary h2 { font-size:23px; }\n      #content.book.p33 .glossary p { font-size:18px; line-height:1.35; }\n      #content.book.p33 .folio { font-size:16px; margin:10px 10px 0 0; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center\">\n  <main class=\"w-full\">\n    <div id=\"content\" class=\"container opacity-0 book p33\" data-family=\"reference\">\n      <section data-section-type=\"boxed_text\" data-section-id=\"pg033_sec003\" class=\"b-page\">\n        <div class=\"reading\">\n          <img class=\"reading-badge\" src=\"studio/assets/pg033_thello_badge.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <h1 data-id=\"pg033_n0023\">Thello dijet</h1>\n          <div class=\"passage\">\n            <p class=\"opening\"><span data-id=\"pg033_n0025\">Veshja tradicionale është një nga tiparet që e dallon një komb nga kombet e tjera.</span></p>\n            <p><span data-id=\"pg033_n0026\">Veshjet tradicionale ekzistojnë që nga periudha ilire.</span> <span data-id=\"pg033_n0027\">Simbolet dhe motivet themelore me të cilat janë disenjuar këto veshje u ngjajnë veshjeve ilire.</span> <span data-id=\"pg033_n0028\">Materialet që përdoren për krijimin e këtyre rrobave janë të thurura.</span> <span data-id=\"pg033_n0029\">Kryesisht, këto rroba kanë tri ngjyra kryesore: të bardhë, të zezë dhe të kuqe (e cila është më simbolikja).</span> <span data-id=\"pg033_n0030\">Veshjet tradicionale në Kosovë dallohen sipas krahinave, si: veshja e Dukagjinit, e Hasit, e Llapit, e Rugovës, e Opojës, e Karadakut e të tjera.</span></p>\n            <p><span data-id=\"pg033_n0031\">Në ditët e sotme, në Kosovë veshjet tradicionale përdoren në jetën artistike e kulturore dhe në festa të ndryshme familjare.</span> <span data-id=\"pg033_n0032\">Ato ruhen edhe në muze si dëshmi kulturore për vendin tonë.</span></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <aside class=\"glossary\" aria-labelledby=\"pg033-fjalorthi\">\n          <img src=\"studio/assets/pg033_fjalorthi_badge.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"glossary-copy\"><h2 id=\"pg033-fjalorthi\">Fjalorthi</h2><p><strong>Shajak</strong> - material i punuar nga leshi.</p></div>\n        </aside>\n        <div class=\"folio\" aria-label=\"Faqja 33\">33</div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"interface-container\"></div>\n  <div class=\"relative z-50\" id=\"nav-container\"></div>\n  <script src=\"./assets/offline-preloader.js?v=9f3d745a858de581\"></script>\n  <script src=\"./assets/scorm.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"./assets/base.bundle.local.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"./book-design/responses.js?v=9f3d745a858de581\" data-book-responses=\"true\"></script>\n</body></html>","./pg034_sec001.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq\"><head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Shoqëria dhe mjedisi</title><meta name=\"title-id\" content=\"pg034_sec001\"><meta name=\"page-section-id\" content=\"52\">\n<link href=\"./content/tailwind_output.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><link href=\"./assets/libs/fontawesome/css/all.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><link href=\"./assets/fonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"./book-design/components.css?v=9f3d745a858de581\" data-book-style=\"true\">\n<style>\n#content.book.p34{padding:0 0 100px;max-width:1000px;font-family:BookPoppins,Arial,sans-serif;color:#30313a;container-type:inline-size}\n#content.book.p34 .sheet{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-rat